      "text": "**Initiating Research on AI Detection**\n\nI\u0027m starting my deep dive into AI text detection. I\u0027ll be looking into the foundational concepts, focusing on the differences between human and AI writing. Also, I\u0027m exploring different methods for separating text from the various LLM models.\n\n\n**Investigating Core AI Detection Concepts**\n\nI\u0027m now focusing on core concepts. I\u0027m actively researching the statistical and machine learning methods used in AI text detection, aiming to understand the techniques. Then I will evaluate common metrics. After, I\u0027ll aim to create a comprehensive explanation for the user. I\u0027ll remember the persona and technical terms!\n\n\n",
